    "updated_at": "2021-08-18T19:26:53Z",
    "body": "I have pushed some commits fixing some test cases.\r\nMost of the issues were related to `async_send_request(request)` now returning a `std::future` and not a `std::shared_future`, which is a breaking change (get() consumes a the internal state for an unique future, but returns a reference for the shared one).\r\n\r\nWe will have to add a release note and run full CI before merging this.",
